  "title": "Alla Checca",
  "description": "This marvelous sauce is the reason you grow your own tomatoes. Dice a few and add minced garlic, fresh basil, and the best quality olive oil you can buy. Let the heady mixture rest at room temperature for a few hours, then toss with hot pasta.",
  "authors": [
